  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1130231.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">226 fotos del segon torn de l&#39;Escoleta d&#39;Estiu Infantil a Onda </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/P1120475.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">(4 de l&#39;&uacute;ltim dia del segon torn de l&#39;Escoleta de Cer&agrave;mica al Museu del Taulell, de la qual encara queden dos torns fins al 21 d&#39;agost). Paral.lelament s&#39;ha desenvolupat l&#39;Escoleta Esportiva, gestionades les tres per M&oacute;n d&#39;Animaci&oacute;.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120430.jpg\" alt=\"p1120430\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120431.jpg\" alt=\"p1120431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120432.jpg\" alt=\"p1120432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120433.jpg\" alt=\"p1120433\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120434.jpg\" alt=\"p1120434\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120435.jpg\" alt=\"p1120435\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/segontornescoletaestiuinfantil/p1120436.jpg\" alt=\"p1120436\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;